164
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,880
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

165
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:32,800
 He could just command Jesus, you better come and heal my son.

166
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,800
 If not, I'll put you in jail or I'll kill you.

167
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,480
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

168
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:41,400
 Why would he come and beg a Jew?

169
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,960
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

170
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:50,760
 I feel like he already exhausted all his ways and all

171
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:53,400
 his connections, and he still can't find healing for his son.

172
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,760
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

173
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:03,600
 You can see, you can have all the money and power

174
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,960
 that you want, but death is still

175
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,320
 within everyone's destiny.

176
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,760
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

177
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:18,440
 Only Jesus proved the wrong through his empty grave.

178
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,000
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

179
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:27,120
 See, in verse 48, this is how Jesus responded.

180
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:31,680
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

181
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:34,480
 In English, the you is actually plural.

182
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,240
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

183
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:41,000
 Jesus is not just responding to the official.

184
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,840
 He's responding to the crowd also.

185
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,200
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

186
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:50,720
 Jesus said, you believe in me because of my miracle

187
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:53,480
