188
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,040
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

189
00:10:58,120 --> 00:11:01,240
 They see Jesus as a miracle worker,

190
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:03,400
 and he became famous right now.

191
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,800
 [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

192
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:10,880
 See, Jesus brought pride and recognition

